 ```
 
+To link an installed librats (its CMake package, `rats::rats`) instead of the
+submodule — the submodule then need not be checked out:
+
+```bash
+cmake -S . -B build -DRASYNC_USE_SYSTEM_LIBRATS=ON -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/opt/librats
+```
+
+The installed librats must be at least the release the submodule pins (2.3.3).
+One built from a tarball without `-DRATS_VERSION_OVERRIDE` reports itself as
+1.0.0; pass `-DRASYNC_LIBRATS_MIN_VERSION=` to accept it anyway.
+
